{
  "$description": "Stemma's design tokens, in the Design Tokens Community Group format. A navy ramp identifies the product and its dark surfaces (sidebars, the front page, app icons); the work sits on light surfaces and white cards. Names are semantic, so the dark appearance, under `dark`, redefines the semantic colours alone. Contrast ratios are measured against the surface each token is meant for. The first level of every path is its category; the rest is the token's name.",
